OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses told to still be
OL,4,Acareful using water
OL,5,
OL,6,FCar washes, data centres and factories
OL,7,Fare being encouraged to use water
OL,8,F"responsibly" as drought conditions
OL,9,Fcontinue.
OL,11,FEssex and Suffolk Water (ESW) said it
OL,12,Fis "working closely" with businesses,
OL,13,Flocal authorities and retailers to
OL,14,F"reduce their demand and cut water
OL,15,Fwaste".
OL,17,FThe supplier said a temporary use ban -
OL,18,Fintroduced on 3 August - had led to a
OL,19,F15% drop in water demand from business
OL,20,Fcustomers, but it was "important that
OL,21,Fthese reductions continue".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
