OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses told to still be
OL,4,Acareful using water
OL,5,
OL,6,FESW said reservoir levels remained
OL,7,Fbelow normal for this time of year,
OL,8,Fwith only 5% of average rainfall
OL,9,Frecorded so far in August.
